language ESSENCE' 1.0
$ Thirteen people, 4 of them male, enter a room one at a time; the ratio of females to males in the room must never exceed 7/3.
find sequence : matrix indexed by [int(1..13)] of bool

branching on [sequence]

such that
$ exactly 9 females (true) and 4 males (false) enter the room
(sum i : int(1..13) . sequence[i]) = 9,
$ at every point, the females in the room are at most 7/3 of the males in the room: 3F <= 7M with M = k - F, i.e. 10F <= 7k
forAll k : int(1..13) . (10 * (sum i : int(1..k) . sequence[i])) <= 7 * k
